meta {
  name: 04 problems
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  The RFC 9457 contract, asserted on a REGISTERED domain problem rather than on a
  protocol refusal, so the envelope, the `data` extension, and the versioned type
  URI are all exercised at once.

  The problem is `NoteTitleConflict` from `App/Error/NoteTitleConflict.cs`,
  registered in `App/Error/ServiceProblems.cs` at 409 against
  `POST /api/v1/notes`.
}
